{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Magic systems differ in their bookkeeping, not in their effects. An at-will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cantrip, a spell memorized from a book and spent in the speaking, a bolt paid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for out of an energy pool, and a scroll good for one reading all do the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sort of thing to the world; what separates them is when the game says no. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library keeps the two apart. A spell’s effect is an ordinary rule body, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly as any other rule body is, and a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sits beside it deciding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"availability and price."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A spell’s identity is its own intent, declared with ","type":"text"},{"code":"#verb","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" like any custom","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verb, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"glow","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"cast glow","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"read passwall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are parser rows and a spell can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry as many phrasings as its author wants. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns the actions that intent needs — the cast handler, plus the memorize","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler when the cost is ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — and the game","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"splices them into its ","type":"text"},{"code":"actions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The layer’s own lines name a spell by its ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"word","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — “You fix the unbar spell in your memory” — which is the intent’s name unless ","type":"text"},{"code":"called:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" says otherwise. An intent that is not a word a player reads, ","type":"text"},{"code":"#verb(\"castFire\", …)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", wants ","type":"text"},{"code":"called: \"fire\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or every line about it says “the castFire spell”. The word is display and nothing more: memory is keyed on the intent, so two spells may share a word and are still memorized, cast and spent one at a time.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is a ","type":"text"},{"code":"GameContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" bundle rather than a ","type":"text"},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", because it has state to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"save. The finite spell memory and the energy pool are ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s it owns, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both travel in a save and come back correctly under UNDO; the defaults are 3","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"slots and 12 mana. Everything else is the host’s: the spellbook, the scroll, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"targets, and every word of prose an effect prints. The bundle contributes one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verb of its own — ","type":"text"},{"code":"spells","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"magic","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), which reports what is held in mind and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"how much energy is left — promotes the engine’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"rest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" stub to refilling the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"pool (and teaches it "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"meditate"},{"type":"text","text":"), and adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spell"},{"type":"text","text":" to the parser’s noise words,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast the glow spell"},{"text":" reaches ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"glow"},{"text":". Its own lines are a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", passed at init.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Casting runs gate, effect, pay. Availability is checked first; the effect runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"second and may refuse on its own account with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"require"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reply"},{"text":"; only an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"effect that finished pays. So a firebolt aimed at nothing costs no energy, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scroll read at the wrong wall survives.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Wiring it in","type":"heading","anchor":"Wiring-it-in"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoSpellcasting","","extension Intent {","    #verb(\"glow\", [\"glow\"], [\"cast\", \"glow\"])","    #verb(","        \"firebolt\", [\"firebolt\"], [\"cast\", \"firebolt\"],","        [\"firebolt\", .directObject], [\"cast\", \"firebolt\", \"at\", .directObject])","}","","struct Tower: Game {","    let magic = Spellcasting(memorySlots: 3, maxMana: 12)","","    var content: GameContents { magic }","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { [.glow, .firebolt] }","","    var actions: [IntentAction] {","        magic.spell(.glow, cost: .cantrip) {","            say(\"Pale light seeps from your fingers.\")","        }","        magic.spell(.firebolt, cost: .energy(4)) {","            guard let target = command.directObject else {","                try reply(\"Cast firebolt at what?\")","            }","            target.vanish()","            say(\"Fire leaps from your hand and bursts against \\(target.definiteName).\")","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" spell carries its own memorize intent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the one ","type":"text"},{"code":"spell(_:called:cost:effect:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call registers both halves:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["magic.spell(.unbar, cost: .prepared(book: spellbook, learnVia: .learnUnbar)) {","    try require(!wardedDoor.isOpen, else: \"The door already stands open.\")","    wardedDoor.isOpen = true","    say(\"The warding-marks gutter and die, and the door drifts open.\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"book: nil"},{"text":" and the spell can be memorized anywhere; pass an item and it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has to be in hand.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One memorize verb per prepared spell. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"learnVia"},{"text":" registers a stage-4 action on that intent, and two spells declaring the same one collide: the bootstrap keeps the later and warns that it overrides the earlier. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"memorize unbar"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"memorize seal"},{"text":" are two intents, not one ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"memorize"},{"text":" with an object.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"The worked example","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"The-worked-example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Gramarye\/"},{"type":"text","text":" is a small original game built to test the claim in the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first sentence of this page. It runs one spell per paradigm and chains them so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each opens exactly one obstacle: the cantrip finds the scroll, the memorized","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spell opens the warded door, the energy spell destroys the golem, the scroll","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passes the wall. Remove any one of the four and the amulet is unreachable, which","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is a stronger demonstration than four spells that happen to work. Its design"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"docs\/games\/gramarye.md"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoSpellcasting"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"GnustoSpellcasting","externalID":"GnustoSpellcasting"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/init(memorySlots:maxMana:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/memorySlots","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/maxMana"],"title":"The bundle","anchor":"The-bundle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/SpellList","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Energy"],"title":"The system’s voice","anchor":"The-systems-voice"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)"],"title":"Registering a spell","anchor":"Registering-a-spell"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/cantrip","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/energy(_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/scroll(_:)"],"title":"The four paradigms","anchor":"The-four-paradigms"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/actions","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/noiseWords"],"title":"What the bundle contributes to the host","anchor":"What-the-bundle-contributes-to-the-host"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Gnusto"],"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Four ways a spell becomes available, over one way of writing what it does."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting"]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting","abstract":[{"text":"Four ways a spell becomes available, over one way of writing what it does.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting","title":"GnustoSpellcasting"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/SpellList":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/spelllist","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpellList","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpellList","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/SpellList","abstract":[{"text":"What ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text\/spellsHeld","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is about: the names held in mind, sorted."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Interpolating one prints them as an English list.","type":"text"}],"title":"Spellcasting.SpellList"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/Energy":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/energy","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Energy","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Energy","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Energy","abstract":[{"text":"What ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text\/energy","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is about: the pool’s level against its ceiling.","type":"text"}],"title":"Spellcasting.Energy"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost/energy(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost\/energy(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"energy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/energy(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Draws the given amount from the shared magical-energy pool; refused when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the pool is too low. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rest"},{"text":" restores the pool to full. The amount must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be negative — that would pay the caster back and could refill the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pool past ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxMana"},{"text":" — and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Spellcasting.spell(_:called:cost:effect:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejects one with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fatalError"},{"text":" at registration.","type":"text"}],"title":"SpellCost.energy(_:)"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost/scroll(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost\/scroll(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scroll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/scroll(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Read from the given scroll item, which is consumed when the spell is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cast. Refused unless the scroll is in hand."}],"title":"SpellCost.scroll(_:)"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Spellcasting","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Spellcasting","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting","abstract":[{"text":"A reusable spellcasting layer covering the common RPG magic paradigms —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at-will cantrips, memorized (“Vancian”) spells, an energy\/points pool, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one-shot scrolls — over a single, uniform notion of a spell.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Spellcasting","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/noiseWords":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/noisewords","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noiseWords","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/noiseWords","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"“spell” is filler in a casting game — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast the glow spell"},{"type":"text","text":" should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parse as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast glow"},{"type":"text","text":" — so the layer adds it to the parser’s noise set."}],"title":"noiseWords"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spell","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Intent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"called","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cost","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpellCost","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoSpellcasting9SpellCostO"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"IntentAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto12IntentActionV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers one spell: the stage-4 behavior that casting its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"intent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"performs, and — for a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" spell — the behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of memorizing it via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"prepareIntent"},{"type":"text","text":". Splice the result into the game’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}],"title":"spell(_:called:cost:effect:)"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/Text":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Text","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/text","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The system’s own voice — every line the mechanics print, from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refusals at the availability gate to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spells"},{"type":"text","text":" report. A spell’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"effect","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the game’s prose and never passes through here. Override"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lines at init to re-skin."}],"title":"Spellcasting.Text","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/init(memorySlots:maxMana:text:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/init(memoryslots:maxmana:text:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"memorySlots","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxMana","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Spellcasting","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoSpellcasting0B0V"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18